---
// Library reader moved under Studio (IA consolidation 2026-06-15): Studio is now
// the single books hub and hosts the per-book content reader at /studio/<slug>.
// This redirect preserves any existing /library/<slug> links and bookmarks.
return Astro.redirect(
  Astro.params.slug ? `/studio/${Astro.params.slug}` : "/studio",
  301,
);
---
